               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>ESP32-S3-WROOM-1 is a compact WiFi and Bluetooth 5 (LE) module </photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>ESP32-S3-WROOM-1 is a compact WiFi and Bluetooth 5 (LE) module powered by a dualcore Xtensa¬Æ LX7 processor, designed for IoT and embedded applications with high performance. Price : 3.5$</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Problem: The external arm increased the overall size of the rob</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Problem: The external arm increased the overall size of the robot and reduced its efficiency. Solution: We integrated the arm inside the robot to achieve a more compact design. Why It Is Innovative: Internal arm integration enhances balance while minimizing overall dimensions. Impact: Improves stability, obstacle handling, and maneuverability.</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>We designed an uploader converter board for programming the mai</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>We designed an uploader converter board for programming the main board, featuring an FT232RL module, C945 transistor, AMS1117, SS56, and several capacitors and resistors to ensure stable communication and reliable uploading (FT232RL module price: 2$).</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>QFR RCJ 2026 </photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>QFR RCJ 2026 </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
